{"sha": "47f23231e689a71f1bb87aa1aed0b5e5543215b61cbbf6874588f53f431e3e85", "body": ["\\begin{remark}[曲率的常见误区]", "(i) 平面弧的代数曲率在弧或平面的定向被反转时", "会变号；只有 $\\abs\\kappa$ 与 $R = 1/\\abs\\kappa$", "是纯几何量。一个顺时针绕行的圆", "有 $\\kappa = -1/R$。(ii) 函数图像的公式", "$\\kappa = f''/(1 + f'^2)^{3/2}$ 悄悄取了以 $x$ 为", "参数化方式；把它用于该点附近并非图像的曲线", "（如竖直切线处）是经典的错误。", "(iii) 在 $\\gamma' = 0$ 的点处，", "$T$ 与 $\\kappa$ 都无定义，而", "轨迹可能真正发生断裂", "（见\\cref{ex:b2:curves:cusp}）；求导前务必先检验", "正则性，再对单位切向量求导。(iv) 在空间中，按约定 $\\kappa =", "\\norm{T'} \\geq 0$，因此既没有可能出错的符号，", "也没有可利用的符号——拐点类信息", "转入挠率。(v) 最后，$\\kappa$ 是一个", "\\emph{对弧长的导数}：对非单位速率的参数化而言，", "忘记 $v^3$ 这一因子，", "在\\cref{prop:b2:curves:kappaformula}中，", "这是实践中最常见的错误。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{figure}[ht]", "\\centering", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.6]", "  % parabola y = x^2/2", "  \\draw[->] (-2.2,0) -- (2.4,0) node[below] {$x$};", "  \\draw[->] (0,-0.4) -- (0,2.4) node[left] {$y$};", "  \\draw[thick, ocDarkBlue, domain=-2.1:2.1, smooth, samples=60]", "    plot (\\x, {0.5*\\x*\\x});", "  % osculating circle at vertex: kappa = 1 => R = 1, center (0,1)", "  \\draw[ocRed, dashed] (0,1) circle (1);", "  \\fill[ocRed] (0,1) circle (0.03) node[right, font=\\small]", "    {曲率中心};", "  \\fill (0,0) circle (0.03);", "  % tangent and normal at vertex", "  \\draw[->, thick] (0,0) -- (0.7,0) node[below, font=\\small] {$T$};", "  \\draw[->, thick] (0,0) -- (0,0.7) node[left, font=\\small] {$N$};", "  % a second point", "  \\fill (1.2,0.72) circle (0.03);", "  \\draw[->, thick] (1.2,0.72) -- ++(0.448,0.5376)", "    node[right, font=\\small] {$T$};", "  \\draw[->, thick] (1.2,0.72) -- ++(-0.5376,0.448)", "    node[above, font=\\small] {$N$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "\\caption{抛物线 $y = x^2/2$，其活动标架 $(T,", "N)$ 及顶点处的密切圆（半径 $1$，因为", "$\\kappa(0) = 1$）。标架随点的运动而转动；曲率", "是单位弧长上这种转动的速率。}", "\\label{fig:b2:curves:osculating}", "\\end{figure}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[曲线由曲率决定]\\label{thm:b2:curves:fundamental}", "设 $\\kappa \\colon J \\to \\R$ 为连续函数。则在平面上存在一条", "单位速率的 $\\mathcal{C}^2$ 弧，其曲率为", "$\\kappa$，且在相差一个直保距变换（先旋转", "再平移）的意义下唯一。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "\\emph{存在性。}取 $s_0 \\in J$，并令 $\\varphi(s) =", "\\int_{s_0}^s \\kappa(u)\\,\\dd u$，则", "\\[", "\\tilde\\gamma(s) = \\Bigl(\\int_{s_0}^s \\cos\\varphi(u)\\,\\dd u,\\", "\\int_{s_0}^s \\sin\\varphi(u)\\,\\dd u\\Bigr).", "\\]", "于是 $T(s) = (\\cos\\varphi(s), \\sin\\varphi(s))$ 是单位向量，", "$N(s) = (-\\sin\\varphi, \\cos\\varphi)$，且", "\\[", "T'(s) = \\varphi'(s)\\,(-\\sin\\varphi, \\cos\\varphi)", "= \\kappa(s)\\,N(s) :", "\\]", "因此该弧是单位速率的，曲率为 $\\kappa$。", "", "\\emph{唯一性。}设 $\\gamma_1, \\gamma_2$ 为具有", "相同曲率的单位速率弧。每个单位切向量都可以", "借助一个显式构造提升为角函数：将 $T_j$ 视为复数", "$z_j = a_j + \\iu b_j$，其模为 $1$，取", "$\\varphi_j(0)$ 使 $z_j(0) = \\eu^{\\iu\\varphi_j(0)}$，并令", "\\[", "\\varphi_j(s) = \\varphi_j(0) + \\int_0^s\\det\\bigl(T_j,", "T_j'\\bigr)(u)\\,\\dd u .", "\\]", "由 $\\abs{z_j} = 1$ 得 $\\operatorname{Re}(\\conj{z_j}\\,z_j') =", "0$，故 $\\conj{z_j}\\,z_j' = \\iu\\det(T_j, T_j') =", "\\iu\\,\\varphi_j'$，即 $z_j' = \\iu\\varphi_j'z_j$；于是", "\\[", "\\bigl(z_j\\,\\eu^{-\\iu\\varphi_j}\\bigr)'", "= \\eu^{-\\iu\\varphi_j}\\bigl(z_j' - \\iu\\varphi_j'z_j\\bigr) = 0,", "\\]", "于是处处有 $z_j = \\eu^{\\iu\\varphi_j}$，即 $T_j =", "(\\cos\\varphi_j, \\sin\\varphi_j)$，其中 $\\varphi_j$ 属于", "$\\mathcal C^1$ 类。此外 $\\det(T_j, T_j') = \\det(T_j,", "\\kappa N_j) = \\kappa$，故 $\\varphi_j' = \\kappa$。因此 $\\varphi_2 = \\varphi_1 + c$，", "其中 $c$ 为常数：$T_2$ 是 $T_1$ 绕固定角 $c$ 旋转所得，", "积分可得 $\\gamma_2 = \\rho(\\gamma_1) + w$，其中 $\\rho$ 为", "旋转角为 $c$ 的旋转，$w$ 为常向量。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{remark}", "这是\\emph{几何基本定理}的一维原型：一组完备的", "局部不变量（此处为一个函数）", "在刚体运动下将对象分类。", "下面的三维版本需要两个不变量。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{example}[常曲率", "即圆]\\label{ex:b2:curves:constantkappa}", "在存在性的构造中取 $\\kappa \\equiv \\kappa_0 > 0$：", "$\\varphi(s) = \\kappa_0 s$，则", "\\[", "\\tilde\\gamma(s) = \\Bigl(\\frac{\\sin\\kappa_0s}{\\kappa_0},\\", "\\frac{1 - \\cos\\kappa_0s}{\\kappa_0}\\Bigr) :", "\\]", "这是半径为 $1/\\kappa_0$、中心在 $(0,", "1/\\kappa_0)$ 的圆，按单位速率绕行。", "由定理的唯一性部分，\\emph{任一}", "常曲率 $\\kappa_0$ 的单位速率弧都是半径为", "$1/\\kappa_0$ 的圆的一段（若 $\\kappa_0 = 0$，则为直线）——", "这正是\\cref{ex:b2:curves:kappaexamples}中计算的逆，", "以及\\cref{exo:b2:curves:9}的平面情形。", "\\end{example}", ""]}